      ],
      "en": "David therefore departed from there and escaped to Adullam’s cave. When his brothers and all his father’s house heard it, they went down there to him.",
      "ko": "그러므로 다윗이 그곳을 떠나 아둘람 굴로 도망하매 그 형제와 아비의 온 집이 듣고는 그리로 내려가서 그에게 이르렀고",
      "source_text_hash": "8d5da985bc8ddc44898d452ffcd33c92bd86f048ff46a1c065917ece5b30a122",
      "translation_text_hash": "5cd9f43104415f06c378a9a8e3563471f1c1c8855d2913d740a9b4646e777e88",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
