      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "He brought them before the king of Moab; and they lived with him all the time that David was in the stronghold.",
      "ko": "부모를 인도하여 모압 왕 앞에 나아갔더니 그들이 다윗의 요새에 있을 동안에 모압 왕과 함께 있었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "1903b038fecf5844bdc1ad5f7136635406732d561ea6415c8d5f6d6be01a5ab3",
      "translation_text_hash": "a92a5a80a1e814fd4655d0262d6c688dafbb2c97f3074a2ad3b2d8aa448e7f51",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
